# The build context is the repository root (step 50+51): send only this service and the shared Go modules.
*
!packages/go
!services/billing
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.exe
services/billing/.venv
services/billing/tests
services/billing/__pycache__
services/billing/*.pyc
services/billing/requirements-test.txt
services/billing/openapi.yaml
services/billing/README.md
